INSERT INTO `ai_insights` VALUES (1,'forecaster','PREDICTIVE INTELLIGENCE SUMMARY:\nThe TriSync EWMA engine processed 3903 transactions across a 180-day analysis window. Our multi-horizon analysis identifies 12 ingredient(s) as CRITICAL (projected stockout within 7-day horizon) and 14 ingredient(s) as WARNING (15-day horizon or surge risk). 26 ingredient(s) carry a weekend demand surge flag.\n\nMULTI-HORIZON RISK ASSESSMENT:\nAssam Black Tea (EWMA-7=4402.2508 ml/day, momentum=+1.93% stable) CRITICAL: Stockout Day 1 H7. Fresh Milk (EWMA-7=2221.7509 ml/day, momentum=-15.19% decelerating) CRITICAL: Stockout Day 1 H7. Fructose (EWMA-7=891.3580 ml/day, momentum=+5.73% accelerating) CRITICAL: Stockout Day 2 H7. Remaining 9 CRITICAL (NDC, Matcha Powder, Frappe Base, Strawberry Powder, Mango Powder, Cheesecake Walling, Coffee Powder, Cookies & Cream Powder, Nata de Coco) face stockouts Days 3-7 H7.\nAll 14 WARNING items (Condensed Milk, Oreo Crumbs, Milk Choco Powder, Whipped Cream, Choco Syrup, Blueberry Powder, Graham Crumbs, Honey, Lemon Syrup, Dark Choco Powder, Taro Powder, Caramel Syrup, Red Velvet Powder, Strawberry Jam) face stockouts Days 8-15 H15.\n\nPATTERN DETECTIONS:\nSignificant surge patterns include Mango Powder on Sunday (1.6210), Milk Choco Powder on Sunday (1.6161), and Red Velvet Powder on Tuesday (1.4578). Mango Powder\'s Sunday surge, at 1.6210, indicates demand 62.1% above its weekly average, creating stockout risk even when Monday levels appear sufficient.\n\nPROCUREMENT DIRECTIVES:\nIMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED:\nAssam Black Tea: Order 155180.95 ml\nFresh Milk: Order 84334.52 ml\nFructose: Order 30084.38 ml\nNON-DAIRY CREAMER (NDC): Order 15823.27 g\nMatcha Powder: Order 14086.02 g\nFrappe Base: Order 12373.52 g\nStrawberry Powder: Order 9717.62 g\nMango Powder: Order 9049.04 g\nCheesecake Walling: Order 6008.73 g\nCoffee Powder: Order 5978.24 g\nCookies & Cream Powder: Order 5871.90 g\nNata de Coco: Order 4373.53 g\n\nPRIORITY ORDER WITHIN 48 HOURS:\nCondensed Milk: Order 4086.20 ml\nOreo Crumbs: Order 3965.25 g\nMilk Choco Powder: Order 3919.34 g\nWhipped Cream: Order 3976.72 g\nChoco Syrup: Order 3628.38 ml\nBlueberry Powder: Order 3258.57 g\nGraham Crumbs: Order 3179.50 g\nHoney: Order 3192.15 ml\nLemon Syrup: Order 3192.15 ml\nDark Choco Powder: Order 2961.34 g\nTaro Powder: Order 1790.67 g\nCaramel Syrup: Order 1714.90 ml\nRed Velvet Powder: Order 1719.33 g\nStrawberry Jam: Order 1455.40 ml','2026-05-17 12:07:24'),(2,'financial','EXECUTIVE SUMMARY:\nThe business has experienced a decline this week, with Net Profit shrinking by P1370.12 from P15664.9 to P14294.78. Gross Sales also decreased by P2783, moving from P24456 last week to P21673 this week, indicating a shrinking trend in overall business performance.\n\nMARGIN & COGS ANALYSIS:\nThe Food Cost Margin for this week is calculated at 34.04% (P7378.22 COGS divided by P21673 Gross Sales). This figure falls within the healthy F&B range of 30%-35%, indicating efficient spending relative to sales for this period.\n\nOPERATIONAL LEAKS:\nThis week, the business did not incur any Store Expenses (P0) and reported no Z-Reading Variance (missing cash) at P0. This is an improvement compared to the previous week\'s losses.\n\nCFO RECOMMENDATION:\nGiven the significant decline in Gross Sales and Net Profit, a focused strategy to recover sales volume is imperative; specifically, launch a targeted promotional campaign next week aiming to increase average transaction value by 10% to push Gross Sales back above P24000.','2026-05-17 12:07:29'),(3,'forecaster','PREDICTIVE INTELLIGENCE SUMMARY:\nThe TriSync EWMA engine has processed 3903 transactions across a 180-day historical window. Our analysis identifies 12 ingredients as CRITICAL, indicating projected stockout within the 7-day horizon. An additional 14 ingredients are classified as WARNING, signaling stockout risk within the 15-day horizon or due to specific surge patterns. A total of 26 ingredients exhibit a distinct weekend demand surge.\n\nMULTI-HORIZON RISK ASSESSMENT:\nAssam Black Tea: EWMA-7=4402.2508 ml/day, EWMA-30=4318.6934 ml/day, momentum_velocity is +1.93% (stable). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 1.\nFresh Milk: EWMA-7=2221.7509 ml/day, EWMA-30=2619.6363 ml/day, momentum_velocity is -15.19% (decelerating). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 1.\nFructose: EWMA-7=891.3580 ml/day, EWMA-30=843.0523 ml/day, momentum_velocity is +5.73% (accelerating). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 2.\nNon-Dairy Creamer (NDC): EWMA-7=485.9871 g/day, EWMA-30=448.5235 g/day, momentum_velocity is +8.35% (accelerating). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 3.\nMatcha Powder: EWMA-7=450.2958 g/day, EWMA-30=388.5792 g/day, momentum_velocity is +15.88% (accelerating). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 3.\nFrappe Base: EWMA-7=393.7683 g/day, EWMA-30=345.3128 g/day, momentum_velocity is +14.03% (accelerating). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 4.\nStrawberry Powder: EWMA-7=332.0667 g/day, EWMA-30=259.8262 g/day, momentum_velocity is +27.80% (accelerating). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 4.\nMango Powder: EWMA-7=281.3799 g/day, EWMA-30=286.0655 g/day, momentum_velocity is -1.64% (stable). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 5.\nCheesecake Walling: EWMA-7=219.4819 g/day, EWMA-30=160.7380 g/day, momentum_velocity is +36.55% (accelerating). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 6.\nCoffee Powder: EWMA-7=195.3414 g/day, EWMA-30=190.8451 g/day, momentum_velocity is +2.36% (stable). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 6.\nCookies & Cream Powder: EWMA-7=211.8480 g/day, EWMA-30=157.6189 g/day, momentum_velocity is +34.41% (accelerating). Risk first triggers in H7, projected stockout on Day 6.\nNata de Coco: EWMA-7=134.8872 g/day, EWMA-30=168.9103 g/day, momentum_velocity is -20.14% (decelerating). Risk first triggers in H7,